  <item>
    <title>vol.004生活篇：收藏没有忠诚，有的只是不停的追求</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fed123fa6fa9ebaf4de750</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fed123fa6fa9ebaf4de750</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Mar 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《艺文生活显微镜》将目光聚焦在了瓷器收藏这一文化领域上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收藏，似每个故事最妥帖的终章。但在无人的角落里，有更多浪漫秘密——</span></p><span></span><p><span>在花开于城市早晚的时刻，有关于更多事物的瞬息被呵护着，开启如花序般循环往复的永恒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，就让瓷器收藏家饶芸艳老师带领我们走进瓷器收藏的世界，分享瓷带来的光华灿烂。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——收听时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a>，</span></strong><span>瓷器的脆弱让饶老师想要永久保存。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>，</span></strong><span>收藏让饶老师去往更远的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a>，</span></strong><span>饶老师的收藏是流动的水。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a>，</span></strong><span>在瓷器发展巅峰的宋朝，诞生了哪些艺术至宝？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a>，</span></strong><span>色彩，是饶老师瓷器收藏中最明显的特点。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a>，</span></strong><span>瓷母，用简单外壳包装丰富内心，乾隆审美与现代标准“遥相呼应”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a>，</span></strong><span>窑变是如何发生的？现代烧瓷技术是如何控制窑变发生概率的？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">01:05:00</a>，</span></strong><span>古人确定颜色，今人拓宽色谱。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrDFG-_aU8FdEvrJ9XiBhag5GoMH.m4a" length="75094333" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuMlQ0UmFZRmZOajh1bWkwaURtX0s1SmRkZGgucG5n.png"/>
